---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Morium" description="How Morium collects, uses, and protects your data.">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
		<a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700">&larr; Back to Morium</a>
		<h1 class="mt-6 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/50">Last updated August 17, 2026</p>

		<div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
			<section>
				<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">What we collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">
					When you sign up for Morium, we collect your business name, email, and
					password. Once you're using the product, you'll enter your own
					customers' names, phone numbers, emails, vehicles, and booking
					history — that data belongs to your business, not to us.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">How we use it</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">
					We use your data to run the service you signed up for: showing your
					bookings dashboard, sending the review-request and rebooking emails
					you've turned on, and processing your subscription payment. We don't
					sell your data or your customers' data to anyone, for any reason.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Who we share it with</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">A few specific companies that make Morium work, and nobody else:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
					<li><strong class="text-ink">Stripe</strong> handles your subscription payment. We never see or store your card number.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-ink">Supabase</strong> hosts the database your business's data lives in.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-ink">Resend</strong> delivers the automated emails (review requests, rebooking reminders) your business sends.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Emails and opting out</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">
					Every automated email your business sends through Morium includes an
					unsubscribe link. Anyone who clicks it stops receiving marketing
					emails from your business permanently — that's enforced at the
					database level, not just hidden in a settings page.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Deleting your data</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">
					Cancel your subscription and email us at
					<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="font-semibold text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
					and we'll delete your business's data, including your customers'
					records, from our systems.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Questions</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">
					Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="font-semibold text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and a real person will answer.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
